WEBVTT

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:30.980
Heat waves also, we know,

00:02:31.022 --> 00:02:34.400
that they increase
violence in communities,

00:02:34.442 --> 00:02:37.236
we have correlated it to increased
violence in communities,

00:02:37.236 --> 00:02:40.531
and also they lower the ability
of children to learn.

00:02:41.073 --> 00:02:42.533
And in the cities,

00:02:42.533 --> 00:02:44.952
not everybody, of course,
is affected equally.

00:02:44.994 --> 00:02:50.541
The poor, especially the energy-poor
and the housing-poor are most vulnerable

00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:53.586
as well as people
with pre-existing conditions,

00:02:53.586 --> 00:02:55.630
people above 60 years old,

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.382
pregnant women, young children

00:02:58.382 --> 00:03:03.012
and people that have manual labor jobs.